            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The invention concerns a conveyor (1) for a continuous baking oven (10), wherein the conveyor (1) is of the closed-ring type and comprises an outer surface (2) and an inner surface (3), and wherein the conveyor (1) is equipped with a plurality of seats (4) intended to receive a food product to be cooked, wherein the seats of the plurality of seats have respective mouths (5) essentially open at the level of the outer surface (2) of the conveyor.</p>
